 protocol={'budgets':BUDGETS,'count_rule':'floor(N * nominal_budget + 0.5); same exact count across strategies; denominator all tissue locations, including unavailable stress region','panels':list(PANELS),'encoders':ENCODERS,'primary_model':models,'simple_baseline':'Validation-selected C5 B2a/B2b for the matching geometry; no refit or retuning','cohorts':'Primary frozen train/validation/test plus all four C5 conditional patient folds; frozen C5 predictors/scalers/checkpoints only','regimes':{'open':'All tissue locations eligible; score every unmeasured location. Evaluation membership depends on strategy, an operational unmeasured-tissue estimand.','contiguous':'Freeze C0 block mask nominal 60% observed, replicate 0. The complement is a permanently unavailable contiguous region. All anchors must be outside it; score only that exact same region for every strategy and budget. Other unmeasured locations also have no expression input.'},'policies':{'A0':'Uniform random permutation, seeds 0..9, nested budget prefixes. Report all 10 outcomes.','A1':'Exact greedy farthest-point sampling on physical XY normalized by within-tissue RMS radial distance. Initial point farthest from eligible centroid; ties use first barcode index.','A2':'Exact greedy farthest-point sampling on the eight frozen C5 training-only whitened image PCA components divided by sqrt(8), same initialization and tie rule; no expression clustering.','A3':'Exact FPS on concatenated sqrt(alpha)*spatial and sqrt(1-alpha)*morphology coordinates, i.e. weighted squared Euclidean distance. Alpha grid [0.25,0.5,0.75].','A4':'Skipped: no calibrated frozen uncertainty acquisition score is available; do not invent an uncertainty method in C6A.'},'alpha_selection':'One alpha per encoder. Minimize validation primary-reconstruction MSE averaged equally over both panels, both regimes and all four budgets. Select the best nonrandom strategy for a potential C6B comparator by this same validation score.','seeds':list(range(10)),'negative_controls':'Primary patient, both encoders/panels/regimes and both reconstruction roles, 10%/20%; seeds 0,1,2. NC2 permutes morphology before A2/A3 selection only. NC3 permutes coordinates before A1 selection only. Reconstruct on true coordinates/images.','metrics':'C5 hidden-location gene Pearson/Spearman/MSE/MAE and panel summaries/fractions; whole expression vector hidden. Positive Pearson gain and positive random-minus-strategy MSE reduction mean improvement.','AUC':'Trapezoidal integration over realized 5/10/20/40% fractions divided by their budget span, separately per strategy/seed; no fidelity or monetary threshold.','distance_bins_um':[0,150,300,600,1200,2400,'infinity'],'distance_minimum_locations_for_Pearson':20,'geometry':'Distances over scored hidden sites. Spatial coverage radius is their maximum nearest-anchor distance. All-unmeasured components on frozen C2 graph counted if >=50 nodes. Image coverage is nearest-anchor distance in the C5 PCA space; diversity is exact mean squared pairwise image distance among anchors.','selection_audit':'Freeze every primary/conditional/control full trajectory before any C6 held-out labels are read. Full order and selected-score replay under all-location NaN/random expression corruption, plus independent replay of every test policy.','prediction_audit':'Every run corrupts the entire expression vector at every unobserved location with NaN/random, including outside the stress scoring region; require exact predictions.','setting_gate':'Pearson gain over 10-random-seed mean >=max(0.01, random Pearson SD), relative mean MSE reduction >=2%, and beat at least 8 of 10 seeds on BOTH Pearson and MSE.','PASS_gate':'Same nonrandom strategy/encoder/panel on primary reconstruction: >=2 primary open budgets and >=1 primary stress budget qualify; >=2 conditional patients have qualifying open settings and >=2 have qualifying stress settings. Mean relative MSE reduction across primary+conditional settings nonnegative and at most 25% settings worsen MSE by >2%. Integrity audits pass.','MIXED_gate':'No PASS, but any primary-reconstruction qualifying setting exists, or material changes occur in >=2 conditional patients. Material means absolute Pearson difference >=max(0.01, random SD) AND absolute relative MSE difference >=2%; it may be harm.','NO_EFFECT_gate':'Otherwise after integrity pass; C5 remains valid.','C6B_gate':'Run only after audited C6A PASS_SAMPLING_EFFECT. Freeze a separate adaptive spec first; no C6B files or experiments before that gate.','recommendations':'MIXED -> NEED_SAMPLING_REVIEW; NO_EFFECT -> PROCEED_TO_EXTERNAL_VALIDATION with simple policy; technical failure -> STOP_TECHNICAL. PASS requires authorized C6B before final C6 recommendation. No external validation is executed.','figures':'Fixed TENX99, ResNet18, 10% budget, both geometries, A0 seed0 and A1/A2/A3, over original embedded H&E thumbnail. Other plots retain all patients/strategies, raw random distributions and distances.','interpretation':'Four-patient conditional development, inherited C0 panels and target normalization, overlapping training folds and known prior outcomes. No unbiased external validation, clinical utility, cost savings, or molecular interpretation.'}
